.pytest_cache/

# The geocode cache IS committed on purpose: free hosting has no
# persistent disk, so it ships inside the image to keep the map fast on a
# cold start. It holds place names and coordinates, never names or dates, and
# scripts/warm_geocode_cache.py drops street level places before they reach it
# so that no household from a real tree is pinned in a public repository.
geocode_cache.json.*.tmp

# Real family data. Contains names, dates of birth and birthplaces for people
# who are still living, so it does not belong in a public repository.
gedcomexample.txt
*.ged
!sample.ged
!mock_data.ged

